Viewing the source does not grant ownership. After Phase 1, a paid subscription
license will be required as described in this document.


1. DEFINITIONS

  "Individual" means a natural person using the Software for personal projects,
  learning, hobby games, or freelance work billed in their own name (not as an
  employee or contractor of a company that embeds the Software in a product).

  "Company" means any legal entity (corporation, LLC, partnership, association,
  school, studio, or similar), and any natural person using the Software in the
  course of employment for such an entity, or shipping a commercial product under
  a company brand.

  "License Term" means one (1) year from the date payment is received (or from
  renewal), unless otherwise stated on the purchase receipt.

  "Licensed Material" means the Bazi Software, including source, binaries,
  examples, templates, and documentation distributed in this repository.


